<title>JAPAN: Kaga Electronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kaga Electronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.42		vs	   31.91</p>
<p> Operating   loss 517    million    vs	prft 383 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 313    million    vs	prft 644 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 350    million    vs	prft 302 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 16.70 yen	  vs    prft 15.15 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     21 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kaga Electronics Co Ltd is an independent trading company in electronic products.</p>
</text>
